  "description": "Current positions and stocks of note. Last Update: 07 July 2025",
  "body_html": "<p>This document will be updated at least weekly, you can see the “Last Update” in the subtitle. <em><strong>Changes will be</strong></em> <em><strong>Bold and Italicized</strong></em>. Note that many of my charts and stocks are based off the weekly, as this timeframe allows people time to make decisions on their own. There will be NO DAY TRADES ❌</p><p>Be cognizant that NO ONE can get every stock right…some of these WILL be losers. Risk management is a MUST. Do not come crying to me if something goes against us, it is just the nature of the markets and it is why stops and bracket orders are available. Questions are welcome in the chat, officially Monday to Friday mornings (though I am in the chat far more often). I will copy and paste “Timothy’s Stocks” once a month into a new document, to reduce how much people have to scroll down to view the document. </p><p>Right now for 2025, we are batting <strong>68%</strong> accuracy.</p><p>⬇️ Positions and Watchlist below this line ⬇️</p><div class=\"paywall-jump\" data-component-name=\"PaywallToDOM\"></div><div><hr></div><h2><strong>Timothy’s Position Summary</strong></h2><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BbWe!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa75d81ce-a46c-4888-9007-d524b4eaf7b9_1636x528.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BbWe!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa75d81ce-a46c-4888-9007-d524b4eaf7b9_1636x528.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BbWe!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa75d81ce-a46c